  "releaseNotes": "21.0.0\n* BREAKING: the assembly is now strong-named (public key token 97afac16d27fbdfa); recompile required\n* HTML validation report: ValidationReport.RenderHtml()/SaveHtml() with ValidationReportOptions (de/en/fr)\n* byte[] overloads for Validate(), ValidateAsync() and CanValidate()\n* ValidationResult.ValidationArtefacts and ValidationEngines name the rule sets and engines used\n* Local validation runs CEN EN16931 1.3.17 (BR-AF-*/BR-AG-* are now BR-IG-*/BR-IP-*)\n* PDFs with several embedded invoice XMLs: the valid version is checked, warning PDF-MULTIPLE-INVOICE-XML\n* Faster and more accurate local XSLT engine (158-line EXTENDED invoice: 19 min -> 2 s); XML documentation shipped",
